  heroSubhead: 'Live online Cambridge IGCSE, A-Level, Pearson Edexcel, IB Diploma, American AP, and Ontario Secondary School Diploma (OSSD via Canadian Cross International School partnership) for Omani and expat families — Muscat (MSQ, Al Khuwair, Al Bandar — BSM / Cheltenham / TAISM catchment), Seeb (Sultan\'s School, RGSG Muscat, Downe House Muscat, KGIS), Sohar (Al Batinah North industrial and port city — ABIS IB continuum), Salalah (Dhofar southern coast — British School Salalah), Nizwa (Ad Dakhiliyah interior cultural capital), and Sur (Ash Sharqiyah North coastal — Oman LNG operations). Delivered in Gulf Standard Time (GST UTC+4) — one hour ahead of Nairobi teaching hours.',
  heroValueProp: 'From USD 180/month (~OMR 70/month at current rate). Small live classes 4-6 students, GST time zone one hour ahead of EAT, Cambridge/IB/AP/Ontario OSSD pathway options. Immediate enrolment — no 6-12 month waiting lists like BSM or ABA. Sultan Qaboos University, GUtech, Muscat University plus UK/US/Canadian/Australian destinations reachable.',
