  citiesSectionTitle: 'Where our Omani and expat families are',
  citiesSectionBody: 'Smartious Omani and expat families concentrate across Muscat (MSQ — BSM/ABA catchment, Al Khuwair, Al Bandar — Cheltenham/Downe House catchment, Al Ghubra — Indian School Muscat catchment), Seeb (Sultan\'s School, RGSG Muscat, Downe House Muscat, KGIS in Al Hail South), Sohar (Al Batinah North industrial and port — ABIS IB continuum), Salalah (Dhofar southern coast — British School Salalah, Port of Salalah corporate), Nizwa (Ad Dakhiliyah interior cultural capital — underserved international curriculum market), and Sur (Ash Sharqiyah North eastern coastal — Oman LNG operations). Each region has its own local context — Muscat premium school waiting-list bypass, Sohar industrial rotation portability, Salalah fee-arbitrage against BSM Salalah, Nizwa and Sur international curriculum access without Muscat relocation — but all share the same live online delivery infrastructure in GST UTC+4.',

