  // ── Universities in country (v2 hub) ──────────────────────────
  universitiesInCountry: 'Sultan Qaboos University (public, main national university, established 1986), German University of Technology in Oman (GUtech, Muscat — German-partnered engineering and applied sciences), Muscat University (partnership with Aston University UK), University of Nizwa (private, established 2004), Dhofar University (Salalah), Sohar University (Sohar), Modern College of Business and Science (MCBS Muscat), Middle East College Muscat, Waljat College of Applied Sciences (Muscat), plus specialist colleges. Ministry of Education (MoE) equivalency system between IB Diploma, IGCSE/A-Level, and Omani General Education Diploma authenticates foreign qualifications for Omani university applications.',
  universityChannels: 'Sultan Qaboos University, University of Nizwa, GUtech, Muscat University, Dhofar University, Sohar University all accept Cambridge A-Level, IB Diploma, and American AP via foundation entry (English-medium tracks) alongside Omani General Education Diploma. Omani MoE equivalency process authenticates foreign qualifications for Omani employment and university purposes. UK UCAS applications supported through Cambridge A-Level or IB Diploma, US Common Application via SAT/ACT + AP portfolios, Canadian OUAC via Ontario OSSD (CCIS partnership) or as international student via Cambridge/IB, Australian direct entry via A-Level or IB, German university applications via Studienkolleg pathway (particularly relevant given GUtech partnership context). Personalised university guidance sessions with the Head of Academics for target-university strategy.',
  cambridgeCardDescription: 'Smartious\'s primary offer for Omani and expat families. Cambridge IGCSE (Years 10-11) and Cambridge A-Level (Years 12-13) delivered as live online classes with 1-hour offset from Nairobi teaching. Private candidate examination registration at British Council Muscat. Pathway accepted by Sultan Qaboos University, GUtech, University of Nizwa, plus UK Russell Group (including Oxbridge for elite candidates), US Ivy League, Canadian U15, Australian Group of Eight.',
  britishCurriculumSuits: 'Omani and expat families targeting Cambridge IGCSE + A-Level pathway — Cambridge is the dominant Oman international exam board across BSM, Cheltenham, RGSG Muscat, KGIS, ABQ Seeb, and other British-curriculum schools. Best fit for families targeting UK Russell Group, Sultan Qaboos University, GUtech, Muscat University, or Australian and Canadian universities.',
  britishCurriculumDelivery: 'Live online classes GST 10 AM – 1 PM (matching 9 AM – 12 PM Nairobi teaching) or 3 PM – 6 PM afternoon slot, small groups 4-6 students. Cambridge examinations at British Council Muscat.',
  ibDiplomaSuits: 'Omani and expat families targeting IB Diploma\'s breadth. BSM (dual A-Level/IB), Sultan\'s School (IB Y12-13), ABIS Sohar, NWIS (adding 2026) alternative. Best fit for families targeting US Ivy League, Canadian U15, holistic university applications, and international-mobile diplomatic and corporate families.',
  ibDiplomaDelivery: 'Live online IB DP classes across all six subject groups plus Theory of Knowledge and Extended Essay supervision.',
  americanCurriculumSuits: 'Omani and expat families targeting US universities via Common Application, plus TAISM (only US Embassy sponsored school in Oman) alternative. AP portfolio strengthens US applications; SAT/ACT preparation integrated.',
  americanCurriculumDelivery: 'American Curriculum with AP courses Grades 9-12, SAT/ACT preparation, Common App essay coaching.',
  founderBioCountrySpecific: 'Alfred Ouko founded Smartious in 2019 to make international qualifications (Cambridge, IB, American, Ontario OSSD) accessible to families across emerging markets at online-delivery fees. Omani and expat families in Oman join students in 16 other countries — from Muscat MSQ to Kuwait City Sharq, Istanbul Bebek to Cairo Zamalek, Dubai Downtown to Kuala Lumpur Mont Kiara.',
  founderUniversitySpecialism: 'Alfred holds a BEd in Mathematics and Physics — Smartious\'s Cambridge A-Level and IB Diploma STEM subjects are led personally when needed. Head of Academics supervises curriculum delivery and university placement strategy per family.',

